      "content": "wait, u mentioned race conditions in the token refresh? that sounds a bit heavy. we've got massive auto-scaling set up for the release, so i don't think we'll actually hit those crazy high-load peaks right away. is it really that big of a deal? like, is it a \"stop the release\" kind of problem, or just something we can monitor and fix in a quick v2.4.1 patch next week if we see any weirdness?",
